  "description_target": {
    "ambiguity_notes": "The executable rule classifies any red component by the number of cells in its top row, but every official object is an exact vertical T-tetromino. Generated training scenes preserve that intended object vocabulary; broad tests separately cover the implementation boundary. Both tallies saturate after four objects.",
